# Code owners for OpenCode Mobile.
#
# This is a single-maintainer project: @Eslamasabry owns everything by
# default. The explicit entries below are not a different owner — they mark
# the paths where a review is load-bearing rather than routine, so that a
# future co-maintainer inherits the map instead of guessing.
#
# CODEOWNERS only enforces review if branch protection requires it. Enabling
# that is an owner-side setting, not something this file can do.

*                                       @Eslamasabry

